quote.text:
Anyone waiting for the ChatGPT moment for robotics is going to miss the first wave of adoption

@Standardbots are already deployed to hundreds of customers across almost every state
@DynaRobotics has robots deployed across restuarant chains, hotels, logistics, data centers
@PathRobotics has robots welding across defense, oil & gas, energy companies and signed a $600m deal with HII, one of the largest shipbuilding companies

We will eventually build a big single model that works out of the box for anything, but specialized models are starting to tackle massive labor markets today

